    baslik: Where to get psychological support in Famagusta
    metin: |-
      Famagusta Psychology Centre is a private psychology centre in Famagusta offering individual therapy, [couples therapy](/en/blog/couples-therapy-famagusta.html) and [family therapy](/en/blog/family-therapy-famagusta.html) in both Turkish and English. The centre serves a wide range of clients, from university students and local residents to expats and international professionals.

      If you live in a more remote area or cannot attend in person, online sessions are also available via a secure video platform.
  - type: metin
    baslik: Does "my problem isn't serious enough" hold you back?
    metin: |-
      Many people feel they need to be "bad enough" to deserve therapy. This is one of the biggest barriers to accessing mental health support. Yet therapy is not a last resort for crises — it is a proactive investment in your mental wellbeing.

      Constant tiredness, loss of motivation, recurring relationship conflict, work stress or a persistent sense of heaviness — all of these are valid reasons to speak to a psychologist.
